## ?? Release Build Phase

### Prerequisites for Release
- [ ] All functional tests passed
- [ ] No critical bugs remaining
- [ ] All features tested
- [ ] Performance acceptable
- [ ] Privacy policy finalized
- [ ] Terms of Service finalized
- [ ] Support email configured
- [ ] Version number updated

### Create Signing Keystore
```bash
keytool -genkey -v -keystore meengle.keystore \
  -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000 \
  -alias meengle-release
```
- [ ] Keystore file created: `meengle.keystore`
- [ ] Password set and saved securely
- [ ] Store path saved: `~/.android/meengle.keystore` (recommended)
- [ ] Keystore backed up in secure location

### Build Release APK
```bash
cd android
./gradlew assembleRelease
cd ..
```
- [ ] Build completed successfully
- [ ] APK generated: `android/app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release-unsigned.apk`
- [ ] File size reasonable (< 50MB)
- [ ] No build warnings about resources

### Sign Release APK
```bash
jarsigner -verbose -sigalg SHA1withRSA -digestalg SHA1 \
  -keystore ~/.android/meengle.keystore \
  android/app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release-unsigned.apk \
  meengle-release
```
- [ ] Enter keystore password correctly
- [ ] Signing completed successfully
- [ ] Signed APK created

### Align Release APK
```bash
zipalign -v 4 \
  android/app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release-unsigned.apk \
  meengle-release.apk
```
- [ ] Alignment completed successfully
- [ ] Final APK file: `meengle-release.apk` created
- [ ] File size reasonable
- [ ] APK ready for distribution

### Verify Signed APK
```bash
# Verify signature
jarsigner -verify -verbose -certs meengle-release.apk

# Or use apksigner (better)
apksigner verify --print-certs meengle-release.apk
```
- [ ] Signature verified successfully
- [ ] Certificate details correct
- [ ] No warning messages

